sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant Platform
    participant DB
    participant Audit

    Admin->>Platform: Create Employee
    Platform->>DB: Save User
    Admin->>Platform: Assign Department
    Platform->>DB: Update User
    Admin->>Platform: Assign Team
    Platform->>DB: Update Team Mapping
    Admin->>Platform: Assign Role
    Platform->>DB: Save Role Mapping
    Platform->>DB: Grant Default API Access
    Platform->>Audit: Record Onboarding Event
    Audit-->>Admin: Employee Ready
